#: plugin/includes/Admin/Menu.php
msgid "This site does not use https. Clone requests are signed, but the package would travel unencrypted: switch the site to https first if you can."
msgstr "Bu site https kullanmıyor. Klon istekleri imzalı, ancak paket şifrelenmeden aktarılır; mümkünse önce siteyi https'e geçirin."

